   "stem": {
      "text": "The table gives values of the differentiable functions f and g and their derivatives at selected values of x. Let \\( h(x) = f(g(x)) \\). The entry for \\( g'(1) \\) is missing, but \\( h'(1) = -4 \\). Find \\( g'(1) \\).",
