   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = f'(g(x)) \\cdot g'(x) \\). From the table, \\( g(1) = 4 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 4: \\( f'(4) = 1 \\).",
         "rule_named": "chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "So \\( -4 = h'(1) = 1 \\cdot g'(1) \\), and \\( g'(1) = -4 \\).",
